      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHIPSTICK BOBBI (2) could manage only second last time but ran useful time (23.89) at this track over 425m when beaten 2.75 lengths in a Grade 5 FIN. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. ASTON MANDLA (3) was below best last time finishing fourth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Restricted WIN win two back at this track. Has the ability and can find best this time. PAW INFLAME (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (24.11) at this track. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Hard to beat again. LEKTRA ROSA (7) won last start after racing on the pace. Right in the mix.",
